{
  "title": "Nutty Mediterranean Pistachio Skillet",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Mediterranean dish featuring unsalted pistachio and confit-tomato, cooked in an iron teppan skillet. This paleo-friendly recipe is perfect for a quick and nutritious meal.",
